@startuml F5.8-ERRO-evento-com-presenca
title F5.8-ERRO — 422 excluir evento com presença
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "EventController" as Ctrl
participant "DeleteEventUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: Excluir evento
WebApp -> Jwt: DELETE /events/{id}
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: count attendances
Postgres --> UC: count > 0
note right of UC
  sem DELETE
end note
UC --> WebApp: 422 event_has_attendances
WebApp --> Sec: Toast erro

@enduml
